{"id":"W2a087266d1f52b28a074a8e1","zh":"上、下界限谱","en":"","name":"上、下界限谱","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C720ab37a7daff28ee8fe","families":[],"definition_zh":"文中用于表达轨道不平顺谱密度上下边界的谱。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W2a087266d1f52b28a074a8e1","text":"上、下界限谱","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sc4da7eefc27f13d197ef","source_id":"P105","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"Journal of Railway Science and Engineering Volume 13 Number 2 February 2016 武广客运专线通用轨道谱及其反演简化算法陈宪麦 1,2,向尚 1,徐磊 3,贺天龙 1,陈文韬 1,贾晨 (1.中南大学土木工程学院,湖南长沙410075; 2.高速铁路建造技术国家工程实验室,湖南长沙410075; 3.西南交通大学牵引动力国家重点实验室,四川成都610031) 摘要: 基于铁路轨道精细化管理的需要,针对武广客运专线2013 年全年的轨道不平顺检测数据进行功率谱密度的计算与统计处理,采用新的4 参数拟合公式,建立武广客运专线上、下界限谱和建议谱的通用谱结构及拟合参数。","citations":[{"source_id":"P105","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"sources":{"P105":{"id":"P105","title":"武广客运专线通用轨道谱及其反演简化算法","authors":"陈宪麦,向尚,徐磊,贺天龙,陈文韬,贾晨","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.02.004","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-study-on-general-track-spectrum-and-the-simplified-inverse-algorithm-of-wuhan-guangzhou-passenger-sp"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W9be9800cbf5f3714742c9f83","name":"upper-lower boundaries","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W9be9800cbf5f3714742c9f83","name":"upper-lower boundaries","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W9be9800cbf5f3714742c9f83","name":"upper-lower boundaries","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P105","title":"武广客运专线通用轨道谱及其反演简化算法","authors":"陈宪麦,向尚,徐磊